WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.018
In Emerald Sprawl, turn 1 does not arrive as a recap.

2
00:00:02.018 --> 00:00:04.036
It hits like a district pulse, and everyone watching can feel which corner of the city just lost its balance.

3
00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.055
We have a developing situation in Rust Market runners.

4
00:00:06.055 --> 00:00:08.073
Old favors came due around a failed gear reconciliation and shoved Debt Heat to the front of the board.

5
00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:10.091
Behind the desk, the next move is already visible. Ashline Circle crews: Track Awakened push as a live board move.

6
00:00:10.091 --> 00:00:12.109
GM work changes the board here; it does not just annotate it after the fact.

7
00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:14.127
The city remembers the crews that move first and the districts that fail to recover.

8
00:00:14.127 --> 00:00:16.146
Tonight the city closes on this reality: Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77 heat.

9
00:00:16.146 --> 00:00:18.164
Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with delta 8.

10
00:00:18.164 --> 00:00:20.182
Tomorrow the board opens again, and the next faction that hesitates will be seen.
